invariant: INV-5
file: src/x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: x509_pem_integer_to_bytes stops refusing a leading zero octet
  before an octet whose top bit is clear, which canonical DER refuses
  (X.690 section 8.3.2). test_written writes such a dq, which the ladder
  never reads.

--- old
    bad |= first_zero & ((second >> 7) ^ 1);
--- new
    (void)second;
